ncy (ELP) to North American Standard Out-of-Service Criteria; roadside OOS enforcement begins (follows Apr-28-2025 executive order). Jan-1 to Jun-24-2025: 7,812 ELP violations, only 33 OOS.","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/08/10/2026-16288/english-language-proficiency-out-of-service-criteria"},{"date":"2025-07","what":"~1,500 drivers placed OOS for ELP in first weeks of enforcement (July 2025 report cited by FreightWaves)","url":"https://www.freightwaves.com/news/more-than-7000-truckers-reportedly-sidelined-for-english-proficiency-violations"},{"date":"2025-07..2025-09","what":"Overdrive/CCJ analysis: ELP OOS orders ran 'just shy of 1,700 drivers a month' in the first three full months of enforcement (monthly run-rate)","url":"https://www.ccjdigital.com/regulations/safety-compliance/article/15831944/fmcsa-proposes-outofservice-rule-for-trucker-english-proficiency"},{"date":"2025-10-17","what":"~6,000 commercial drivers removed from service for ELP since enforcement began (cumulative, federal sources via FreightWaves)","url":"https://www.freightwaves.com/news/speaking-english-is-no-longer-optional-over-6000-drivers-have-found-out-the-hard-way"},{"date":"2025-10-30","what":"Sec. Duffy: 7,248 drivers placed OOS for ELP (cumulative). FMCSA inspection database showed at least 5,006 ELP OOS violations through October.","url":"https://www.freightwaves.com/news/more-than-7000-truckers-reportedly-sidelined-for-english-proficiency-violations"},{"date":"2025-12-10","what":"Sec. Duffy: 9,500 drivers sidelined for ELP (cumulative); FMCSA database count 8,953 OOS ELP violations","url":"https://www.freightwaves.com/news/9500-truck-drivers-sidelined-for-english-language-violations-dot-chief-says"},{"date":"2025-12","what":"Overdrive: 10,000+ CDL drivers placed OOS for ELP violations since June 2025 (cumulative); ~12,500 ELP OOS orders recorded in H2-2025 per later Overdrive tally","url":"https://www.overdriveonline.com/business/article/15774485/10000-cdl-drivers-placed-outofservice-for-english-langauge-proficiency-violations-wheres-the-rates-bump"},{"date":"2025-12","what":"ELP violations tied to only 184 carriers undergoing authority revocation in Dec-2025 (Trucking Dive analysis) - minimal direct link between ELP and carrier exits","url":"https://www.truckingdive.com/news/fmcsa-grants-reinstatements-revocations-operating-authority-2025-data/808968/"},{"date":"2026-01","what":"Coordinated 3-day, 26-state ELP enforcement operation placed nearly 500 drivers OOS; California Highway Patrol began ELP OOS enforcement in Jan-2026 (only 9 federal ELP OOS recorded in CA before)","url":"https://www.ttnews.com/articles/english-proficiency-rule-2026"},{"date":"2026-02-13","what":"FMCSA final rule 'Restoring Integrity to the Issuance of Non-Domiciled CDLs' published; eligibility limited to H-2A/H-2B/E-2 visa holders; FMCSA estimates ~194,000 of ~200,000 non-domiciled CDL holders affected. Effective 2026-03-16.","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/02/13/2026-02965/restoring-integrity-to-the-issuance-of-non-domiciled-commercial-drivers-licenses-cdl"},{"date":"2026-03-06","what":"California DMV cancels ~13,000 non-domiciled CDLs (after DOT withheld $160M in highway funds); later court ruling ordered restoration but licenses remained revoked","url":"https://www.freightwaves.com/news/the-non-domiciled-cdl-crackdown-has-arrived-13000-drivers-out-a-national-rule-a-few-days-away"},{"date":"2026-03-19","what":"FMCSA NPRM data: 60,399 ELP violations issued Jun-25-2025 to Mar-19-2026, of which 19,045 resulted in OOS orders (cumulative). NPRM projects ~9,000 additional OOS/yr in border commercial zones once codified.","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/08/10/2026-16288/english-language-proficiency-out-of-service-criteria"},{"date":"2026-03","what":"Operation Highway Shield phase 1 (Florida): 176 OOS orders, 35 criminal arrests","url":"https://www.freightwaves.com/news/federal-crackdown-leads-to-arrest-of-86-